# Required. API key for the Subconscious streaming SDK, which backs the
# Practice Coach agent. Without it, POST /api/agent fails at request time.
SUBCONSCIOUS_API_KEY=your-key-here

# Port the Express sidecar listens on. Vite proxies /api/agent and /api/tools
# here, so changing this means updating the proxy in frontend/vite.config.ts.
PORT=3001

# Origin allowed by CORS — the Vite dev server.
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

# Public base URL for this server's own tool endpoints. Subconscious runs the
# reasoning loop remotely and calls music_theory_lookup / research_paper_lookup
# back over HTTP, so this MUST be publicly reachable — run `ngrok http 3001`
# and paste the forwarding URL here. The localhost default will not work: the
# agent silently fails its tool calls.
TOOL_BASE_URL=https://your-subdomain.ngrok-free.app
